{"version":1,"content":"<p>香港天文台表示，颱風薔琵已減弱為強烈熱帶風暴。</p><p>台鐵表示，今天（24日）中午12時後西部、東部幹線等陸續恢復正常行駛；</p><p>颱風影響編組，部分列車截短或停駛，籲旅客出門前可先詢問台鐵最新運行資訊。</p><p>【詳情可瀏覽台鐵網頁】</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-24T02:44:13.923281+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":108,"images":0,"source":"明報 中國","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-24T02:11:19+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-24T15:58:09.402999+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-24T02:38:17.092539+00:00","content_hash":"637d2b150ef8bc565344b5981b7fb2a93359e3e97982a35a35f26e72e1cb0ee5","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}